OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FStaying
OL,6,Fcloudy in the east with rain becoming
OL,7,Fheavier and more persistent through
OL,8,Fthe evening and overnight. Dry in the
OL,9,Fnorth and west at first but showery
OL,10,Frain developing overnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloud and occasionally
OL,13,Fheavy rain soon clearing the east.
OL,14,FOtherwise bright spells and a few
OL,15,Fshowers, becoming increasingly dry and
OL,16,Fbright through the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
