OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fstart Thursday with some brightness.
OL,7,FBecoming windy as cloud and rain pass
OL,8,Feast Thursday afternoon and evening.
OL,9,FBright spells and a few showers
OL,10,FFriday. Rain or showers on Saturday.
